#: automation_templates.php
msgid "Represents the final desired Device description to be used in Cacti.  The following replacement values can be used: |sysName|, |ipAddress|, |dnsName|, |dnsShortName|, |sysLocation|.  The following functions can also be used: CONCAT(), SUBSTRING(), SUBSTRING_INDEX().  See the MySQL/MariaDB documentation for examples on how to use these functions.  An example would be: CONCAT('|sysName|', SUBSTRING('|sysLocation|',1,3)).  Take care to include quoting around the variables names when used in the supported MySQL/MariaDB function examples."
msgstr "Imele incazelo yokugcina edingekayo Yedivayisi ezosetshenziswa ku-Cacti. Amanani alandelayo okushintsha angasetshenziswa: |sysName|, |ipAddress|, |dnsName|, |dnsShortName|, |sysLocation|. Imisebenzi elandelayo nayo ingasetshenziswa: CONCAT(), SUBSTRING(), SUBSTRING_INDEX(). Bona amadokhumenti e-MySQL/MariaDB ukuze uthole izibonelo zokuthi le misebenzi isetshenziswa kanjani. Isibonelo singaba: CONCAT('|sysName|', SUBSTRING('|sysLocation|',1,3)). Qaphela ukufaka izimpawu zokucaphuna ezungeze amagama eziguquguqukayo lapho esetshenziswa ezibonelweni zemisebenzi ye-MySQL/MariaDB esekelwayo."

