msgid "WARNING: This change will not change either the step or the heartbeat of existing RRDfiles.  After this change, a Rebuild Poller Cache operation will take place in background to update the data collection cycle for the impacted Data Sources.  It is strongly suggested that you either delete all the impacted RRDfiles afterwards, or use the splice_rrd.php CLI script to preserve old data and repopulate the new RRDfiles with the legacy data.  Otherwise, this change will have no on the data and may in fact lead to a loss of fidelity if you are increasing the time between data collection cycles."
msgstr "ISEXWAYISO: Lolu shintsho ngeke lushintshe isinyathelo (step) noma i-heartbeat yamafayela e-RRD akhona. Ngemva kwalolu shintsho, umsebenzi Wokwakha Kabusha Inqolobane ye-Poller uzokwenzeka ngemuva ukuze ubuyekeze umjikelezo wokuqoqwa kwedatha weMithombo Yedatha ethintekile. Kuphakanyiswa kakhulu ukuthi ususe wonke amafayela e-RRD athintekile ngemva kwalokho, noma usebenzise iskripthi se-CLI esithi splice_rrd.php ukuze ulondoloze idatha endala futhi ugcwalise kabusha amafayela amasha e-RRD ngedatha endala. Uma kungenjalo, lolu shintsho ngeke lube nomthelela kudatha futhi lungaholela ekulahlekeni kokunemba uma wenyusa isikhathi phakathi kwemijikelezo yokuqoqwa kwedatha."

