#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Bulk Walk Maximum Repetitions"
msgstr "Ukuphindaphinda Okuphezulu kwe-Bulk Walk"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "For SNMPv2 and SNMPv3 Devices, the SNMP Bulk Walk max-repetitions size. The default is to 'Auto Detect on Re-Index'. For very large switches, high performance servers, Jumbo Frame Networks or for high latency WAN connections, increasing this value may increase poller performance. More data is packed into a single SNMP packet which can reduce data query run time. However, some devices may completely refuse to respond to packets with a max-repetition size which is set too large. This can be especially true for lower-powered IoT type devices or smaller embedded IT appliances. Special attention to the overall network path MTU should also be considered since setting a value which is too high could lead to packet fragmentation."
msgstr "Kumadivayisi e-SNMPv2 ne-SNMPv3, usayizi wokuphindaphinda okuphezulu we-SNMP Bulk Walk. Okuzenzakalelayo ku-'Thola Ngokuzenzakalelayo Ekuhleleni Kabusha Inkomba'. Kumaswishi amakhulu kakhulu, amaseva asebenza kahle kakhulu, Amanethiwekhi e-Jumbo Frame noma ekuxhumaneni kwe-WAN okune-latency ephezulu, ukukhulisa leli nani kungathuthukisa ukusebenza kwe-poller. Idatha eyengeziwe ipakishwa ephaketheni elilodwa le-SNMP elinganciphisa isikhathi sokusebenza kombuzo wedatha. Kodwa-ke, amanye amadivayisi angala ngokuphelele ukuphendula amaphakhethi anosayizi wokuphindaphinda okuphezulu obekwe phezulu kakhulu. Lokhu kungaba yiqiniso ikakhulukazi kumadivayisi ohlobo lwe-IoT anamandla aphansi noma izinto ezincane ze-IT ezishumekiwe. Ukunakwa okukhethekile ku-MTU yendlela yonke yenethiwekhi kufanele futhi kucatshangelwe njengoba ukusetha inani eliphezulu kakhulu kungaholela ekuhlukaneni kwamaphakhethi."

