#: include/global_form.php
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Ukungalinganisi Negridi (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "Ukuze kugwenywe imiphumela yokufiphala ye-anti-aliasing, i-RRDtool ihlanganisa amaphuzu namaphikseli wokucaca kwedivayisi, lokhu okuletha ukubukeka okucace bha. Uma lokhu ungakuthandi, ungasebenzisa lesi shintshi ukucisha lokhu kuziphatha.<br><strong>Qaphela: </strong>Ukulinganisa negridi kucishiwe kokuphuma kwe-PDF, EPS, SVG ngokuzenzakalelayo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Igridi Ye-Y Ehlukile (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "I-algorithm iqinisekisa ukuthi uhlala unegridi, ukuthi kunemigqa yegridi eyanele kodwa engeminingi kakhulu, nokuthi igridi ingeyemethrikhi. Le pharamitha izophinde iqinisekise ukuthi uthola amadesimali anele abonisiwe ngisho noma igrafu yakho isuka ku-69.998 iye ku-70.001.<br><strong>Qaphela: </strong>Le pharamitha ingase iphazamise izinketho ezithi --alt-autoscale."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Izinketho Zama-eksisi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "I-eksisi Yangakwesokudla (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "I-eksisi yesibili izodwetshwa ngakwesokudla kwegrafu. Ixhunywe ku-eksisi yangakwesobunxele ngamapharamitha esikali nokushintsha."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Ilebula Ye-eksisi Yangakwesokudla (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Ilebula ye-eksisi yangakwesokudla."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label Angle (--right-axis-label-angle)"
msgstr "I-engeli Yelebula Ye-eksisi Yangakwesokudla (--right-axis-label-angle)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right label rotation in degrees counter clockwise. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank follows the vertical label angle. Angles other than 90 and 270 may overlap nearby content."
msgstr "Ukuzungezwa kwelebula yangakwesokudla ngamadigri ngokuphambene newashi. Kudinga i-RRDtool 1.11 noma entsha. Ukushiya kungenalutho kulandela i-engeli yelebula eme mpo. Ama-engeli angafani no-90 no-270 angase agqagqane nokuqukethwe okuseduze."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label Range (--right-axis-range)"
msgstr "Ibanga Lelebula Ye-eksisi Yangakwesokudla (--right-axis-range)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Only show right axis labels within min:max, for example 0:100. Either bound may be blank. This does not change the axis scale. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank leaves labels unrestricted."
msgstr "Bonisa kuphela amalebula e-eksisi yangakwesokudla ngaphakathi kuka-min:max, isibonelo u-0:100. Noma yimuphi umkhawulo ungaba ongenalutho. Lokhu akushintshi isikali se-eksisi. Kudinga i-RRDtool 1.11 noma entsha. Ukushiya kungenalutho kushiya amalebula engenamkhawulo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Ifomethi Ye-eksisi Yangakwesokudla (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Ngokuzenzakalelayo, ifomethi yamalebula e-eksisi inqunywa ngokuzenzakalelayo. Uma ufuna ukukwenza lokhu ngokwakho, sebenzisa le nketho ngezimpikiswano ezifanayo ze-%lf ozaziyo emiyalweni ye-PRINT ne-GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Isifomethi se-Eksisi Yesokudla (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Uma usetha ukulebula kwe-eksisi yesokudla, sebenzisa umthetho kufomethi yedatha. Amafomethi asekelwayo ahlanganisa u-\"numeric\" lapho idatha iphathwa njengamanani, u-\"timestamp\" lapho amanani ehunyushwa njengezitembu zesikhathi ze-UNIX (inani lamasekhondi kusukela ngoMasingana 1970) futhi avezwa kusetshenziswa ifomethi ye-strftime (okuzenzakalelayo ngu-\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Bheka futhi u---units-length no---right-axis-format. Okokugcina u-\"duration\" lapho amanani ehunyushwa njengobude besikhathi ngamamilisekhondi. Ukufometha kulandela imithetho ye-PRINT/GPRINT efaneleke nge-valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Format (--left-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Ifomethi ye-Eksisi Yesobunxele (--left-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Isifomethi se-Eksisi Yesobunxele (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Uma usetha ukulebula kwe-eksisi yesobunxele, sebenzisa umthetho kufomethi yedatha. Amafomethi asekelwayo ahlanganisa u-\"numeric\" lapho idatha iphathwa njengamanani, u-\"timestamp\" lapho amanani ehunyushwa njengezitembu zesikhathi ze-UNIX (inani lamasekhondi kusukela ngoMasingana 1970) futhi avezwa kusetshenziswa ifomethi ye-strftime (okuzenzakalelayo ngu-\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\"). Bheka futhi u---units-length. Okokugcina u-\"duration\" lapho amanani ehunyushwa njengobude besikhathi ngamamilisekhondi. Ukufometha kulandela imithetho ye-PRINT/GPRINT efaneleke nge-valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Izinketho ze-Legend"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Ukugcwalisa Isikhala Okuzenzakalelayo"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Gcwalisa isikhala sombhalo ukuze i-legend nedatha yegrafu kuhlale kuqondana ngaso sonke isikhathi. Qaphela: lokhu kungabangela ukuthi amagrafu athathe isikhathi eside ukukhiqizwa ngenxa yomsebenzi owengeziwe. Futhi Ukugcwalisa Isikhala Okuzenzakalelayo kungase kungabi nembayo kuzo zonke izinhlobo zamagrafu, ukulebula okungaguquguquki kuvame ukusiza."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dynamic Labels (--dynamic-labels)"
msgstr "Amalebula Aguqukayo (--dynamic-labels)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Draw line markers as a line."
msgstr "Dweba izimpawu zomugqa njengomugqa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force Rules Legend (--force-rules-legend)"
msgstr "Phoqelela i-Legend Yemithetho (--force-rules-legend)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force the generation of HRULE and VRULE legends."
msgstr "Phoqelela ukukhiqizwa kwama-legend e-HRULE ne-VRULE."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Tab Width (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"
msgstr "Ububanzi beThebhu (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "By default the tab-width is 40 pixels, use this option to change it."
msgstr "Ngokuzenzakalelayo ububanzi bethebhu bungamaphikseli angu-40, sebenzisa le nketho ukuze ukushintshe."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Position (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"
msgstr "Indawo ye-Legend (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend at the given side of the graph."
msgstr "Beka i-legend ohlangothini olushiwo lwegrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Direction (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"
msgstr "Isiqondiso se-Legend (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend items in the given vertical order."
msgstr "Beka izinto ze-legend ngokulandelana okuqondile okunikeziwe."

#: include/global_form.php lib/api_aggregate.php
msgid "Graph Item Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo Lwento Yegrafu"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data for this item is represented visually on the graph."
msgstr "Indlela idatha yale nto evezwa ngayo ngokubonakalayo kugrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The data source to use for this graph item."
msgstr "Umthombo wedatha ozosetshenziselwa le nto yegrafu."

#: include/global_form.php lib/html.php
msgid "Primary Color"
msgstr "Umbala Oyinhloko"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The color to use for the canvas item and legend."
msgstr "Umbala ozosetshenziselwa into ye-canvas ne-legend."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Primary Opacity"
msgstr "I-Opacity Eyinhloko"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The opacity of the primary color."
msgstr "I-opacity yombala oyinhloko."

#: include/global_form.php lib/html.php
msgid "Gradient Color"
msgstr "Umbala we-Gradient"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The gradient color to use for the canvas item."
msgstr "Umbala we-gradient ozosetshenziselwa into ye-canvas."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Gradient Opacity"
msgstr "I-Opacity ye-Gradient"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The opacity of the gradient color."
msgstr "I-opacity yombala we-gradient."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Gradient Height"
msgstr "Ubude be-Gradient"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The Gradient Height parameter can create three different behaviors. If it is > 0, then the gradient is a fixed height, starting at the line going down. If it is < 0, then the gradient starts at a fixed height above the x-axis, going down to the x-axis. If it is == 0, then the gradient goes from the top of the area fill to x-axis."
msgstr "Ipharamitha yoBude be-Gradient ingakha ukuziphatha okuthathu okuhlukene. Uma > 0, i-gradient iba nobude obungaguquki, iqala emugqeni yehla. Uma < 0, i-gradient iqala ebudeni obungaguquki ngaphezu kwe-x-axis, yehla iya ku-x-axis. Uma == 0, i-gradient isuka phezulu kokugcwaliswa kwendawo iya ku-x-axis."

#: include/global_form.php lib/rrd.php
msgid "Consolidation Function"
msgstr "Umsebenzi Wokuhlanganisa"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data for this item is represented statistically on the graph."
msgstr "Indlela idatha yale nto evezwa ngayo ngokwezibalo kugrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "CDEF Function"
msgstr "Umsebenzi we-CDEF"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A CDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph or legend."
msgstr "Umsebenzi we-CDEF (wezibalo) ozosetshenziswa kule nto kugrafu noma ku-legend."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "VDEF Function"
msgstr "Umsebenzi we-VDEF"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A VDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph legend."
msgstr "Umsebenzi we-VDEF (wezibalo) ozosetshenziswa kule nto ku-legend yegrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Shift Data"
msgstr "Gudluza Idatha"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Offset your data on the time axis (x-axis) by the amount specified in the 'value' field."
msgstr "Gudluza idatha yakho ku-eksisi yesikhathi (x-axis) ngenani elishiwo emkhakheni we-'value'."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "[HRULE|VRULE]: The value of the graph item.<br/> [TICK]: The fraction for the tick line.<br/> [SHIFT]: The time offset in seconds."
msgstr "[HRULE|VRULE]: Inani lento yegrafu.<br/> [TICK]: Ingxenyana yomugqa wokumaka.<br/> [SHIFT]: Ukugudluzwa kwesikhathi ngamasekhondi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "GPRINT Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo lwe-GPRINT"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "If this graph item is a GPRINT, you can optionally choose another format here. You can define additional types under \"GPRINT Presets\"."
msgstr "Uma le nto yegrafu iyi-GPRINT, ungakhetha enye ifomethi lapha uma uthanda. Ungachaza izinhlobo ezengeziwe ngaphansi kwe-\"Amasethingi Angaphambilini e-GPRINT\"."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Alignment (TEXTALIGN)"
msgstr "Ukuqondaniswa Kombhalo (TEXTALIGN)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "All subsequent legend line(s) will be aligned as given here.  You may use this command multiple times in a single graph.  This command does not produce tabular layout.<br/><strong>Note: </strong>You may want to insert a &lt;HR&gt; on the preceding graph item.<br/> <strong>Note: </strong>A &lt;HR&gt; on this legend line will obsolete this setting!"
msgstr "Yonke imigqa ye-legend elandelayo izoqondaniswa njengoba kunikezwe lapha. Ungasebenzisa lo myalo izikhathi eziningi kugrafu eyodwa. Lo myalo awukhiqizi isakhiwo sethebula.<br/><strong>Qaphela: </strong>Ungase ufune ukufaka i-&lt;HR&gt; entweni yegrafu eyandulelayo.<br/> <strong>Qaphela: </strong>I-&lt;HR&gt; kulo mugqa we-legend izokwenza lesi sethingi singasebenzi!"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Format"
msgstr "Ifomethi Yombhalo"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text that will be displayed on the legend for this graph item."
msgstr "Umbhalo ozovezwa ku-legend yale nto yegrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend for Export/Hover"
msgstr "I-Legend Yokukhipha/Yokubeka Phezulu"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A Legend to be displayed when Hovering over the Graph and also used for Graph Export.  Hover requires RRDtool 1.9.1 and above.  It may work for RRDtool 1.8+, but not for Thold Legends."
msgstr "I-Legend ezovezwa uma ubeka ngaphezu kweGrafu futhi esetshenziselwa Nokukhipha Igrafu. Ukubeka ngaphezu kudinga i-RRDtool 1.9.1 nangaphezulu. Ingase isebenze ku-RRDtool 1.8+, kodwa hhayi kuma-Legend e-Thold."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Insert Hard Return"
msgstr "Faka Ukweqa Umugqa Okuqinile"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Forces the legend to the next line after this item."
msgstr "Kuphoqelela i-legend ukuthi iye emugqeni olandelayo ngemva kwale nto."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Line Width (decimal)"
msgstr "Ububanzi Bomugqa (idesimali)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In case LINE was chosen, specify width of line here.  You must include a decimal precision, for example 2.00"
msgstr "Uma kukhethwe u-LINE, cacisa ububanzi bomugqa lapha. Kufanele ufake ukunemba kwedesimali, isibonelo 2.00"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dashes (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"
msgstr "Imigqa enqamukayo (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The dashes modifier enables dashed line style."
msgstr "Isilungisi se-dashes sinika amandla isitayela somugqa onqamukayo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dash Offset (dash-offset=offset)"
msgstr "Ukususwa Komugqa Onqamukayo (dash-offset=offset)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The dash-offset parameter specifies an offset into the pattern at which the stroke begins."
msgstr "Ipharamitha ye-dash-offset icacisa ukusuka kuphethini lapho umugqa uqala khona."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name given to this graph template."
msgstr "Igama elinikezwe lesi sifanekiso segrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The Class of this Graph Template."
msgstr "Isigaba salesi Sifanekiso seGrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The Version given to this Graph Template."
msgstr "Inguqulo enikezwe lesi Sifanekiso seGrafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Multiple Instances"
msgstr "Izibonelo Eziningi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if there can be more than one Graph of this type per Device."
msgstr "Maka leli bhokisi lokuhlola uma kungaba neGrafu engaphezu kweyodwa yalolu hlobo ngeDivayisi ngayinye."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Test Data Sources"
msgstr "Hlola Imithombo Yedatha"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Maka leli bhokisi lokuhlola uma ufisa ukuhlola Imithombo Yedatha ngaphambi kokudalwa kwayo. Uma Ukuhlola Imithombo Yedatha kunikwe amandla, uma Umthombo Wedatha ungabuyisi idatha evumelekile, Igrafu ngeke idalwe. Lesi silungiselelo sibalulekile uma ufisa ukuba neSifanekiso Sedivayisi esijwayelekile esingafaka Izifanekiso Zegrafu eziningi ezingasetshenziswa ngokukhetha kuye ngezimpawu zeDivayisi uqobo. Qaphela: Uma uneskripthi esisebenza isikhathi eside njengoMthombo Wedatha, isikhathi sokudala Amagrafu sizokwanda."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a name for this graph item input, make sure it is something you recognize."
msgstr "Faka igama lalokhu okokufakwa kwento yegrafu, qiniseka ukuthi yinto oyaziyo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a description for this graph item input to describe what this input is used for."
msgstr "Faka incazelo yalokhu okokufakwa kwento yegrafu ukuze uchaze ukuthi lokhu okokufakwa kusetshenziselwani."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Field Type"
msgstr "Uhlobo Lwenkambu"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data is to be represented on the graph."
msgstr "Indlela idatha ezomelwa ngayo egrafini."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "General Device Options"
msgstr "Izinketho Ezijwayelekile Zedivayisi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Give this host a meaningful description."
msgstr "Nika lo msingathi incazelo enomqondo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Fully qualified hostname or IP address for this device. IPv6 address insert into brackets (example: [2001:abcd:1234::1])"
msgstr "Igama lomsingathi eliphelele noma ikheli le-IP lale divayisi. Ikheli le-IPv6 lifake kubakaki (isibonelo: [2001:abcd:1234::1])"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free-form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
msgstr "Indawo ebonakalayo yeDivayisi. Lo mbhalo okhululekile ungaba igumbi, indawo yerack, njll."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Poller Association"
msgstr "Ukuhlanganiswa Kwe-Poller"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Device Site Association"
msgstr "Ukuhlanganiswa Kwesayithi Ledivayisi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "What Site is this Device associated with."
msgstr "Yiliphi Isayithi le Divayisi ehlanganiswe nalo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Choose the Device Template to use to define the default Graph Templates and Data Queries associated with this Device."
msgstr "Khetha Isifanekiso Sedivayisi esizosetshenziswa ukuchaza Izifanekiso Zegrafu ezizenzakalelayo kanye Nemibuzo Yedatha ehlotshaniswa nale Divayisi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Number of Collection Threads"
msgstr "Inani Lama-thread Okuqoqa"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The number of concurrent threads to use for polling this device.  This applies to the Spine poller only."
msgstr "Inani lama-thread asebenza kanyekanye okufanele lisetshenziselwe ukuhlola le divayisi. Lokhu kusebenza ku-poller ye-Spine kuphela."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Check this box to disable all checks for this host."
msgstr "Maka leli bhokisi ukuze ukhubaze konke ukuhlolwa kwalo msingathi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Availability/Reachability Options"
msgstr "Izinketho Zokutholakala/Ukufinyeleleka"

#: include/global_form.php include/global_settings.php
msgid "Downed Device Detection"
msgstr "Ukutholwa Kwedivayisi Engasebenzi"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The method Cacti will use to determine if a host is available for polling.  <br><i>NOTE: It is recommended that, at a minimum, SNMP always be selected.</i>"
msgstr "Indlela i-Cacti ezoyisebenzisa ukunquma ukuthi umsingathi uyatholakala yini ukuze uhlolwe.  <br><i>QAPHELA: Kunconywa ukuthi, okungenani, i-SNMP ikhethwe njalo.</i>"

#: include/global_form.php include/global_settings.php
msgid "Downed Device SNMP Recovery Options Set"
msgstr "Iqoqo Lezinketho Zokubuyisela I-SNMP Yedivayisi Engasebenzi"

#: include/global_form.php include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a Device goes down, use this SNMP Option Set to attempt to re-establish communication with the device and update the devices settings based upon the first matching SNMP Options Set."
msgstr "Uma iDivayisi iyeka ukusebenza, sebenzisa leli Qoqo Lezinketho ze-SNMP ukuzama ukuxhumana kabusha nedivayisi futhi ubuyekeze izilungiselelo zedivayisi ngokusekelwe eqoqweni lokuqala lezinketho ze-SNMP elihambisanayo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The type of ping packet to send.  <br><i>NOTE: ICMP on Linux/UNIX requires root privileges.</i>  <br><i>NOTE: TCP Ping Closed - Even if the tcp ping is not successful, the device can be considered UP.</i>"
msgstr "Uhlobo lwephakeji ye-ping okufanele luthunyelwe.  <br><i>QAPHELA: I-ICMP ku-Linux/UNIX idinga amalungelo e-root.</i>  <br><i>QAPHELA: I-TCP Ping Closed - Noma i-tcp ping ingaphumelelanga, idivayisi ingathathwa njenge-UP.</i>"

#: include/global_form.php sites.php
msgid "Additional Information"
msgstr "Ulwazi Olwengeziwe"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Created"
msgstr "Kudalwe"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Date/time the device was added to Cacti"
msgstr "Idethi/isikhathi lapho idivayisi yengezwe khona ku-Cacti"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter notes to this host."
msgstr "Faka amanothi kulo msingathi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "External ID"
msgstr "I-ID Yangaphandle"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "External ID for linking Cacti data to external monitoring systems."
