msgstr "Uhlu oluhlukaniswe ngokhefana lwama-ID Edivayisi ofisa ukuthi abe kumodi ye-Debug ngesikhathi sokuqoqwa kwedatha.  Leli zinga le-Debug lisebenza kuphela ngesikhathi senqubo yokuhlola kwe-Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Syslog/Eventlog Item Selection"
msgstr "Ukukhethwa Kwento Ye-Syslog/Eventlog"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using Syslog/Eventlog for logging, the Cacti log messages that will be forwarded to the Syslog/Eventlog."
