#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Ezinye izindawo zokusebenzelana ze-Cacti zisekela Ukudonsa Nokudedela. Uma kumakiwe le nketho izonikwa amandla. Qaphela: Kubasebenzisi abanokukhubazeka kokubona, le nketho ingakhutshazwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "GitHub/GitLab API Settings"
msgstr "Amasethingi E-API Ye-GitHub/GitLab"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Base API Repository URL"
msgstr "I-URL Yerephozithori Ye-API Eyisisekelo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to get the latest plguins versions directly from GitHub or GitLab enter the GitHub or GitLab API url here.  The default is https://api.github.com/.  Change this only if you have your own repository that you maintain for Cacti Plugins."
msgstr "Uma ufisa ukuthola izinhlobo zakamuva zama-plugin ngqo kusuka ku-GitHub noma ku-GitLab faka i-URL ye-API ye-GitHub noma ye-GitLab lapha. Okwakhona ngu-https://api.github.com/. Shintsha lokhu kuphela uma unerephozithori yakho oyinakekelayo Yama-Plugin E-Cacti."

