#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to get the latest plguins versions directly from GitHub without overly restricted rate limiting, enter your Personal Access Token here."
msgstr "Uma ufisa ukuthola izinhlobo zakamuva zama-plugin ngqo kusuka ku-GitHub ngaphandle kokulinganiselwa kwezinga okuqinile kakhulu, faka Ithokheni Yakho Yokufinyelela Yomuntu Siqu lapha."

