msgstr "Khetha Indawo Yamaphakheji ofisa ukuwangenisa."

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Replace Suggested Value Patterns"
msgstr "Faka Esikhundleni Amaphethini Enani Eliphakanyisiwe"

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Replace Data Source and Graph Template Suggested Value Records.  Graphs and Data Sources will take on new names after either a Data Query Reindex or by using the forced Replace Suggested Values process."
msgstr "Faka Esikhundleni Amarekhodi Enani Eliphakanyisiwe Omthombo Wedatha NeThemplethi Yegrafu. Amagrafu Nemithombo Yedatha kuzothatha amagama amasha ngemva Kokuhlelwa Kabusha Kwemibuzo Yedatha noma ngokusebenzisa inqubo ephoqelelwe ethi Faka Esikhundleni Amanani Aphakanyisiwe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Ukuphepha Kwesayithi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Phoqelela Ukuxhumana nge-HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Uma kumakiwe, noma yimiphi imizamo yokufinyelela i-Cacti izoqondiswa kabusha ku-HTTPS ukuze kuqinisekiswe ukuphepha okuphezulu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Inline JavaScript Protection"
msgstr "Ukuvikelwa Kwe-JavaScript Phakathi Emugqeni"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls how the Content-Security-Policy restricts inline JavaScript.  HTMX keeps the 'unsafe-inline' policy that all current themes and plugins rely on and matches the behaviour of prior releases.  Nonce Migration emits a strict nonce policy in report-only mode so incompatible core and plugin scripts can be identified without breaking the UI.  Nonce Enforcement blocks scripts without the request nonce and requires CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE to be true in include/config.php; without that explicit gate it safely remains in report-only mode.  None also permits unsafe eval() calls and is the least restrictive option."
msgstr "Ilawula indlela i-Content-Security-Policy ebeka ngayo imikhawulo ku-JavaScript engaphakathi kolayini. I-HTMX igcina inqubomgomo ye-'unsafe-inline' okuncike kuyo zonke izindikimba nama-plugin amanje futhi ihambisana nokusebenza kwezinguqulo ezedlule. Ukuthuthela ku-Nonce kukhipha inqubomgomo eqinile ye-nonce esimweni sokubika kuphela ukuze izikripthi ezingahambisani zomgogodla nama-plugin zikhonjwe ngaphandle kokuphula i-UI. Ukuphoqelela i-Nonce kuvimba izikripthi ezingenayo i-nonce yesicelo futhi kudinga ukuthi i-CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE ibe ngu-true ku-include/config.php; ngaphandle kwalelo sango elicacile ihlala iphephile esimweni sokubika kuphela. I-None iphinde ivumele izingcingo ze-eval() ezingaphephile futhi iyinketho enemikhawulo emincane kakhulu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "HTMX (Default)"
msgstr "I-HTMX (Okuzenzakalelayo)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Migration (Report Only)"
msgstr "Ukuthuthela ku-Nonce (Okokubika Kuphela)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Enforcement (Advanced)"
msgstr "Ukuphoqelela i-Nonce (Okuthuthukile)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "I-URI Yombiko Wokwephulwa kwe-CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Used in Nonce Migration and Nonce Enforcement modes.  URL where browsers post Content-Security-Policy violation reports.  Leave blank to use the bundled csp_report.php handler under the configured Cacti URL path."
msgstr "Isetshenziswa ezimweni Zokuthuthela ku-Nonce Nokuphoqelela i-Nonce. I-URL lapho iziphequluli zithumela khona imibiko yokwephulwa kwe-Content-Security-Policy. Shiya kungenalutho ukuze usebenzise isiphathi esiyi-csp_report.php esihlanganiswe ne-Cacti ngaphansi kwendlela ye-URL ye-Cacti emisiwe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Imithombo Ehlukile ye-Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space-delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can include wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Amagama ezizinda ahlukaniswe ngesikhala azokuvunyelwa ukufinyelelwa ngaphandle kweSeva yeWebhu ngokwayo. Lokhu kubalulekile kubasebenzisi abakhetha ukusebenzisa i-CDN, noma isiza sokusingatha. Imithombo ingabandakanya ama-wildcard isibonelo: *.mydomain.com, noma iphrothokholi, isibonelo: https://*.example.com. Le Mithombo Ehlukile ihlanganisa izinhlobo zeSithombe, i-CSS ne-JavaScript kuphela."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable htmx for in-place filter updates"
msgstr "Nika amandla i-htmx yezibuyekezo zezihlungi endaweni efanayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, the htmx loader is included so pages that opt in can refresh their filter results without a full page reload. Disable only if plugins misbehave."
msgstr "Uma kunikwe amandla, isilayishi se-htmx siyafakwa ukuze amakhasi akhethayo akwazi ukuvuselela imiphumela yawo yokuhlunga ngaphandle kokulayisha kabusha ikhasi lonke. Khubaza kuphela uma ama-plugin engasebenzi kahle."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On (default)"
msgstr "Vuliwe (okuzenzakalelayo)"

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Valiwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent"
msgstr "Umenzeli Okude"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using multiple Data Collectors, there are the Settings for Communicating between Data Collectors"
msgstr "Uma usebenzisa Abaqoqi Bedatha abaningi, lezi yizilungiselelo Zokuxhumana phakathi Kwabaqoqi Bedatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Imbobo ye-TCP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The TCP Port used for communicating with the Remote Data Collectors.  The protocol will match the Central Cacti web server (either HTTP or HTTPS).  Leave blank to use the default ports."
msgstr "Imbobo ye-TCP esetshenziselwa ukuxhumana Nabaqoqi Bedatha Abakude. Iphrothokholi izohambisana neseva yewebhu ye-Cacti Emaphakathi (kungaba i-HTTP noma i-HTTPS). Shiya kungenalutho ukuze usebenzise izimbobo ezizenzakalelayo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Isikhathi, ngamasekhondi, iseva yewebhu ye-Cacti Emaphakathi ezolinda ngaso impendulo evela Kumqoqi Wedatha Okude ukuze ithole imininingwane ehlukahlukene Yedivayisi ngaphambi kokudela isicelo. Kumadivayisi ahlotshaniswa Nabaqoqi Bedatha abahlukile kuMqoqi Wedatha we-Cacti Omaphakathi, Umenzeli Okude kufanele asetshenziswe ukuqoqa imininingwane Yedivayisi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Verify Remote Agent TLS Certificates"
msgstr "Qinisekisa Izitifiketi ze-TLS Zomenzeli Okude"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require a trusted certificate whose name matches the Remote Data Collector hostname. Disable only while replacing legacy self-signed certificates."
msgstr "Dinga isitifiketi esithembekile esinegama elihambisana negama lomsingathi loMqoqi Wedatha Okude. Khubaza kuphela ngenkathi ushintsha izitifiketi ezindala ezizisayinele."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "No (Legacy Self-signed Certificate)"
msgstr "Cha (Isitifiketi Esidala Esizisayinele)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent CA File"
msgstr "Ifayela le-CA Lomenzeli Okude"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to a PEM CA bundle used to verify Remote Data Collector certificates. Leave blank to use the PHP/OpenSSL system trust store."
msgstr "Indlela ephelele yokuzikhethela eya kunqwaba ye-PEM CA esetshenziselwa ukuqinisekisa izitifiketi zoMqoqi Wedatha Okude. Shiya kungenalutho ukuze usebenzise isitolo sokwethenjwa sesistimu ye-PHP/OpenSSL."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Logging Level"
msgstr "Izinga Lokuloga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Logging level for Automation activities.  Levels are Low, Medium and High."
msgstr "Izinga Lokuloga lemisebenzi Yokuzenzekela. Amazinga athi Phansi, Phakathi Nendawo kanye Nokuphezulu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Serial Automation Scans"
msgstr "Phoqa Ukuhlola Okulandelanayo Kokuzenzekela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti Automation will scan one network at a time not in Parallel.  This setting can be useful when your Cacti Web Servers have limited cores for performing Automation checks."
msgstr "Uma kunikwe amandla, Ukuzenzekela kwe-Cacti kuzohlola inethiwekhi eyodwa ngesikhathi hhayi Ngokuhambisana. Lesi silungiselelo singaba wusizo uma Amaseva Akho Ewebhu e-Cacti enama-core alinganiselwe okwenza ukuhlola Kokuzenzekela."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Nika Amandla Ukudala Igrafu Ngokuzenzakalelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Uma kukhutshaziwe, Ukuzenzekela kwe-Cacti ngeke kudale noma iyiphi Igrafu ngokuzenzakalela. Lokhu kuwusizo uma ulungisa izilungiselelo Zedivayisi ukuze ugweme ukudala Amagrafu amasha njalo uma ulondoloza into. Ukubiza Imithetho Yokuzenzekela ngesandla kuzohlala kungenzeka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Nika Amandla Ukudala Into Yesihlahla Ngokuzenzakalelayo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Uma kukhutshaziwe, Ukuzenzekela kwe-Cacti ngeke kudale noma iyiphi Into Yesihlahla ngokuzenzakalela. Lokhu kuwusizo uma ulungisa izilungiselelo Zedivayisi noma Zegrafu ukuze ugweme ukudala Okufakiwe Kwesihlahla okusha njalo uma ulondoloza into. Ukubiza Imithetho ngesandla kuzohlala kungenzeka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "I-imeyili Yokuthumela Isaziso Sokuzenzekela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Ikheli Le-imeyili okuzothunyelwa kulo Ama-imeyili Ezaziso Zokuzenzekela uma lingacacisiwe ezingeni Lenethiwekhi Yokuzenzekela. Uma le nkambu, noma inani Lenethiwekhi Yokuzenzekela kushiywe kungenalutho, i-Cacti izosebenzisa i-akhawunti Ye-imeyili Yabalawuli Abakhulu be-Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Igama Lomthumeli Lesaziso Sokuzenzekela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Igama Le-imeyili elizosetshenziselwa Ama-imeyili Ezaziso Zokuzenzekela uma lingacacisiwe ezingeni Lenethiwekhi Yokuzenzekela. Uma le nkambu, noma inani Lenethiwekhi Yokuzenzekela kushiywe kungenalutho, i-Cacti izosebenzisa Igama Lomthumeli elizenzakalelayo lesistimu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "I-imeyili Yomthumeli Yesaziso Sokuzenzekela"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Ikheli le-imeyili elizosetshenziswa kuma-imeyili ezaziso zokuzenzakalela uma lingacacisiwe ezingeni lenethiwekhi yokuzenzakalela. Uma le nkambu noma inani lenethiwekhi yokuzenzakalela kushiywe kungenalutho, i-Cacti izosebenzisa ikheli le-imeyili lokuthumela elizenzakalelayo lesistimu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Okuzenzakalelayo kwesifanekiso segrafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Ukuhlola umthombo wedatha wesifanekiso segrafu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Maka leli bhokisi lokuhlola uma ufisa ukuhlola imithombo yedatha ngaphambi kokwakhiwa kwayo ezifanekisweni zegrafu ezintsha nezisanda kungeniswa. Uma ukuhlola imithombo yedatha kuvuliwe, uma umthombo wedatha ungabuyisi idatha evumelekile, igrafu ngeke yakhiwe. Lesi silungiselelo sibalulekile uma ufisa ukuba nesifanekiso sedivayisi esijwayelekile esingafaka izifanekiso zegrafu eziningi ezingasetshenziswa ngokukhetha kuye ngezici zedivayisi uqobo. Qaphela: Uma uneskripthi esisebenza isikhathi eside njengomthombo wedatha, isikhathi sokwakha amagrafu sizokwanda."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Image Format to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Ifomethi yesithombe ezenzakalelayo ezosetshenziswa kuzo zonke izifanekiso zegrafu ezintsha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Graph Height to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Ubude begrafu obuzenzakalelayo obuzosetshenziswa kuzo zonke izifanekiso zegrafu ezintsha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Graph Width to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Ububanzi begrafu obuzenzakalelayo obuzosetshenziswa kuzo zonke izifanekiso zegrafu ezintsha."

