msgstr "Umusho oyimfihlo wobumfihlo we-SNMP v3 ozenzakalelayo wawo wonke amadivayisi amasha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enter the SNMP v3 Context for all new Devices."
msgstr "Faka i-Context ye-SNMP v3 yawo wonke amadivayisi amasha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP v3 Engine Id for all new Devices. Leave this field empty to use the SNMP Engine ID being defined per SNMPv3 Notification receiver."
msgstr "I-Engine ID ye-SNMP v3 ezenzakalelayo yawo wonke amadivayisi amasha. Shiya le nkambu ingenalutho ukuze usebenzise i-SNMP Engine ID echazwe kumamukeli wezaziso we-SNMPv3 ngamunye."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Port Number"
msgstr "Inombolo yembobo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default UDP Port for all new Devices.  Typically 161."
msgstr "Imbobo ye-UDP ezenzakalelayo yawo wonke amadivayisi amasha. Ngokuvamile ngu-161."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP timeout in milli-seconds for all new Devices."
msgstr "Isikhathi sokuphela kwe-SNMP esizenzakalelayo ngamamilisekhondi sawo wonke amadivayisi amasha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "must be a positive integer (milliseconds)."
msgstr "kufanele kube inombolo ephelele engaphezu kukaziro (amamilisekhondi)."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "must be between {{ min }} and {{ max }}."
msgstr "kufanele kube phakathi kuka-{{ min }} no-{{ max }}."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default SNMP retries for all new Devices."
msgstr "Ukuzama kabusha kwe-SNMP okuzenzakalelayo kwawo wonke amadivayisi amasha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "must be a non-negative integer."
msgstr "kufanele kube inombolo ephelele engekho ngaphansi kukaziro."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Behavior"
msgstr "Ukuziphatha kwe-SNMP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Ukusekelwa kwe-SNMP Agent kuvuliwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Uma le nketho imakiwe, i-Cacti izogcwalisa amathebula e-SNMP Agent ngolwazi lwedivayisi nolwesistimu ye-Cacti. Lokhu akuvuli i-SNMP Agent uqobo lwayo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Vula i-MD5 ne-DES ye-SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Ama-algorithm okufakazela e-MD5 nawobumfihlo e-DES amadala, abuthakathaka, futhi awatholakali ekwakhiweni kwe-PHP ne-Net-SNMP okuqinisiwe (FIPS). Uma kuvaliwe, i-MD5 ne-DES kukhishwa ezinhlwini ezehlayo zephrothokholi yokufakazela neyobumfihlo ye-SNMPv3 eziboniswa uma uhlela idivayisi nakuzinketho ze-SNMP zokuzenzakalela, kushiye kuphela ama-algorithm aqinile e-SHA ne-AES."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Vula i-cache yemininingwane yokuqinisekisa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Qinisa kusengaphambili futhi ugcine ku-cache amapharamitha emininingwane ye-SNMPv3 kanye njalo uma imininingwane ishintsha ukuze inqubo ngayinye ye-poller iwasebenzise futhi esikhundleni sokuwakha kabusha kuso sonke isicelo. Lokhu kuletha ukonga okuncane uma uqoqa ngemininingwane ye-SNMPv3 ngamabhanari e-Net-SNMP. Isandiso se-php-snmp siphatha iningi lemisebenzi ye-SNMPv3 get ngaphakathi kwenqubo futhi sidlule le cache, kodwa amabhanari e-Net-SNMP (ngakho-ke nale cache) asasetshenziselwa ama-SNMP walk, okukhiphayo kwe-hex, izicelo ezisetha i-context noma i-engine id, kanye nezinhlanganisela zamaphrothokholi inguqulo ye-PHP esebenzayo engazisekeli. Vula lokhu uma uqoqa noma yimiphi yaleyo misebenzi ngemininingwane ye-SNMPv3."

