#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The polling interval in use.  This setting will affect how often RRDfiles are checked and updated.  <strong><u>NOTE: If you change this value, you must re-populate the poller cache.  Failure to do so, may result in lost data.</u></strong>"
msgstr "Isikhawu sokuhlola esisetshenziswayo. Lesi silungiselelo sizothinta ukuthi ama-RRDfile ahlolwa futhi abuyekezwe kangaki. <strong><u>QAPHELA: Uma ushintsha leli nani, kumele ugcwalise kabusha isilondolozi se-poller. Ukwehluleka ukwenza lokho kungaholela ekulahlekeni kwedatha.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "is not a valid choice."
msgstr "akuyona inketho evumelekile."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Isikhawu Se-Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Ukuvama lapho umqoqi wedatha we-Cacti ezoqaliswa khona. Ungasebenzisa i-crontab, umsebenzi ohleliwe (ku-Windows), noma isevisi ye-cactid systemd ukulawula ukuqaliswa komqoqi wedatha we-Cacti. Ukuze uthole imiyalelo ngokusebenzisa i-daemon ye-cactid, buyekeza ifayela le-README.md kuhla lwemibhalo lwesevisi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Linganisa Umthwalo Wenqubo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Uma ukhetha le nketho, i-Cacti izozama ukulinganisa umthwalo wenqubo ngayinye ye-poller ngokusabalalisa ngokulinganayo izinto ze-poller ngenqubo ngayinye."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Ububanzi Bokuphumayo Bokulungisa Amaphutha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Uma ukhetha le nketho, i-Cacti izohlola okukhiphayo okwedlula amandla e-Cacti okukugcina bese ikhipha isixwayiso uma ikuthola."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Ukuphela Kwesikhathi Se-ejenti Ekude"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Vuselela Ithebula Le-Poller Umjikelezo Ngamunye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Lesi silungiselelo ngesamasistimu e-poller eyodwa kuphela ukuze kwakhiwe kabusha ithebula lokuphumayo le-poller kumjikelezo ngamunye wokuhlola ukuvimbela ithebula lenkumbulo ukuthi lingashintshani (swapping) kumasistimu amakhulu kakhulu anemininingo egciniwe emikhulu engasebenzisa i-swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Replication"
msgstr "Ukuphindaphindwa Komqoqi Wedatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Isikhawu Sokuvumelanisa I-Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Isikhawu esimisiwe sokuvumelanisa ukuhlola esizosetshenziswa uma kwakhiwa i-poller. Lesi silungiselelo sizothinta ukuthi ama-poller akude ahlolwa futhi abuyekezwe kangaki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Khubaza Ukuphindaphindwa Kwesilondolozi Sezinsiza"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Ngokuzenzakalelayo, Umqoqi Wedatha omkhulu we-Cacti uzolondoloza isizindalwazi sonke kanye nama-plugin ku-Resource Cache. Bese, ngezikhathi ezithile Abaqoqi Bedatha Abakude bazozibuyekeza nganoma yiziphi izibuyekezo ezivela kuMqoqi Wedatha omkhulu we-Cacti. Le Resource Cache ivumela Abaqoqi Bedatha Abakude ukuthi bazithuthukise ngokwabo. Uma ungafisi ukusebenzisa le nketho, ungayikhubaza usebenzisa lesi silungiselelo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Automatic Full Sync on Upgrade"
msgstr "Khubaza Ukuvumelanisa Okugcwele Okuzenzakalelayo Ekuthuthukiseni"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, upon upgrading the Main Cacti system, it will perform a Full Sync to all Data Collectors.  This process may be time consuming.  Therefore, to allow upgrades to be completed quicker, we provide this option.  Note that if this is disabled, the Cacti administrator must force this process from the Data Collectors interface after upgrade."
msgstr "Ngokuzenzakalelayo, lapho kuthuthukiswa uhlelo Olukhulu lwe-Cacti, luzokwenza Ukuvumelanisa Okugcwele kubo bonke Abaqoqi Bedatha. Le nqubo ingadla isikhathi. Ngakho-ke, ukuze izithuthukiso ziqedwe ngokushesha, sinikeza le nketho. Qaphela ukuthi uma lokhu kukhubaziwe, umlawuli we-Cacti kufanele aphoqelele le nqubo kusixhumi esibonakalayo Sabaqoqi Bedatha ngemva kokuthuthukisa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo Ezingeziwe Zomqoqi Wedatha"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Ukubhalwa Kwedatha Engavumelekile"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Ungathanda ukuthi amaphutha okukhiphayo Komqoqi Wedatha abhalwe kanjani? Izinketho zifaka: 'Okuningiliziwe' okunikeza imininingwane yawo wonke amaphutha, 'Isifinyezo' esinikeza inani lamaphutha okukhiphayo ngeDivayisi ngayinye, kanye no-'Lutho', okunganikezi izibalo zamaphutha."

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "Isifinyezo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Detailed"
msgstr "Okuningiliziwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of PHP Script Servers"
msgstr "Inani Lamaseva Eskripthi e-PHP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent script server processes to run per spine process.  Settings between 1 and 15 are accepted.  This parameter will help if you are running several threads and script server scripts and is only valid for the spine Data Collector."
msgstr "Inani lezinqubo zamaseva eskripthi ezisebenza kanyekanye ngenqubo ngayinye ye-spine. Izilungiselelo eziphakathi kuka-1 no-15 zamukelekile. Le pharamitha izosiza uma usebenzisa imicu eminingi nezikripthi zamaseva eskripthi futhi isebenza kuphela kuMqoqi Wedatha we-spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Script and Script Server Timeout Value"
msgstr "Inani Lesikhathi Sokuphelelwa Kweskripthi Neseva Yeskripthi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum time that spine will wait on a script to complete.  This timeout value is in seconds and valid for both cmd.php and spine Data Collectors."
msgstr "Isikhathi esiphezulu i-spine ezosilinda ukuze iskripthi siqede. Leli nani lokuphelelwa yisikhathi likumasekhondi futhi lisebenza kubo bobabili Abaqoqi Bedatha be-cmd.php ne-spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Output Not Empty Debouncing"
msgstr "Ukunciphisa Ukuphindaphinda Kwe-Poller Output Not Empty"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you are having issues with some data sources, your Email could be flooded with 'Poller Output Not Empty' warnings.  If this is happening, you can debounce the setting based upon this interval."
msgstr "Uma unenkinga ngeminye imithombo yedatha, i-imeyili yakho ingagcwala izexwayiso ze-'Poller Output Not Empty'. Uma lokhu kwenzeka, unganciphisa ukuphindaphinda kwesilungiselelo ngokusekelwe kulesi sikhathi."

