msgstr "Umkhawulo Wesexwayiso Sesibalo Sehora Elilodwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When the Poller Guarded Ratio (below) is reached breached more than this many times in an hour, a warning will be written to the Cacti log and an Email will be sent to the Primary Cact Administraror notifying them of the Poller runtime deviation."
msgstr "Lapho i-Poller Guarded Ratio (ngezansi) yeqiwe izikhathi ezingaphezu kwalezi ngehora elilodwa, isexwayiso sizobhalwa kulogi ye-Cacti futhi kuthunyelwe i-imeyili kuMlawuli Omkhulu we-Cacti ukuze aziswe ngokuphambuka kwesikhathi sokusebenza se-Poller."

