msgstr "Isikhathi esiphezulu iskripthi se-Cacti se-Background Commands esingasebenza ngaso ngaphandle kokudala iphutha lokuphelelwa yisikhathi nokumiswa. Lesi skripthi sizokwenza imisebenzi efana nokufaka ama-index kabusha Izidivayisi nokususa izidivayisi Kubaqoqi Bedatha Abakude."

