#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Use a separate subfolder for each hosts RRD files.  The naming of the RRDfiles will be one of the following:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>You can make this change after install by running the CLI script <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> after you make the change.  NOTE: If you change Max Directories value to decrease the number of directories, or if you change the Directory Pattern, empty directories will not be pruned after you rerun the <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> script."
msgstr "Sebenzisa ifolda engaphansi ehlukile yamafayela e-RRD omsingathi ngamunye. Ukuqanjwa kwama-RRDfile kuzoba okukodwa kwalokhu okulandelayo:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>Ungenza lolu shintsho ngemva kokufaka ngokusebenzisa iskripthi se-CLI esithi <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> ngemva kokwenza ushintsho. QAPHELA: Uma ushintsha inani le-Max Directories ukuze wehlise inani leziqondisi, noma uma ushintsha Iphethini Yesiqondisi, iziqondisi ezingenanto ngeke zisuswe ngemva kokuphinda usebenzise iskripthi se-<b>structure_rra_paths.php</b>."

