msgstr "I-PHP - Ukusekelwa Kwamamojuli (Kuyadingeka)"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti requires several PHP Modules to be installed to work properly. If any of these are not installed, you will be unable to continue the installation until corrected. In addition, for optimal system performance Cacti should be run with certain MySQL system variables set.  Please follow the MySQL recommendations at your discretion.  Always seek the MySQL documentation if you have any questions."
msgstr "I-Cacti idinga ukuthi kufakwe amamojuli amaningana e-PHP ukuze isebenze kahle. Uma noma yimaphi kulawa engafakiwe, ngeke ukwazi ukuqhubeka nokufaka kuze kube yilapho kulungiswa. Ngaphezu kwalokho, ukuze uhlelo lusebenze ngokufanele, i-Cacti kufanele isetshenziswe kusethwe okuguquguqukayo okuthile kwesistimu ye-MySQL. Sicela ulandele izincomo ze-MySQL ngokubona kwakho. Njalo bheka imibhalo ye-MySQL uma unemibuzo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following PHP extensions are mandatory, and MUST be installed before continuing your Cacti install."
msgstr "Izandiso ze-PHP ezilandelayo ziyimpoqo, futhi KUFANELE zifakwe ngaphambi kokuqhubeka nokufaka kwakho i-Cacti."

