#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following PHP extensions are recommended, and should be installed before continuing your Cacti install.  NOTE: If you are planning on supporting SNMPv3 with IPv6 or SNMPv3 with stronger ciphers, you should not install the php-snmp module at this time."
msgstr "Izandiso ze-PHP ezilandelayo ziyanconywa, futhi kufanele zifakwe ngaphambi kokuqhubeka nokufaka kwakho i-Cacti. QAPHELA: Uma uhlela ukusekela i-SNMPv3 nge-IPv6 noma i-SNMPv3 ngama-cipher aqinile, akufanele ufake imojuli ye-php-snmp ngalesi sikhathi."

