msgid "Your MySQL TimeZone database is not populated.  Please populate this database before proceeding."
msgstr "Isizindalwazi sakho se-MySQL TimeZone asigcwalisiwe. Sicela ugcwalise lesi sizindalwazi ngaphambi kokuqhubeka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Cacti database login account does not have access to the MySQL TimeZone database.  Please provide the Cacti database account \"select\" access to the \"time_zone_name\" table in the \"mysql\" database, and populate MySQL's TimeZone information before proceeding."
msgstr "I-akhawunti yakho yokungena kusizindalwazi se-Cacti ayinayo imvume yokufinyelela kusizindalwazi se-MySQL TimeZone. Sicela unikeze i-akhawunti yesizindalwazi se-Cacti ukufinyelela kwe-\"select\" kuthebula le-\"time_zone_name\" kusizindalwazi se-\"mysql\", futhi ugcwalise ulwazi lwe-TimeZone ye-MySQL ngaphambi kokuqhubeka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Cacti database account has access to the MySQL TimeZone database and that database is populated with global TimeZone information."
msgstr "I-akhawunti yakho yesizindalwazi se-Cacti inokufinyelela kusizindalwazi se-MySQL TimeZone futhi leso sizindalwazi sigcwaliswe ngolwazi lwe-TimeZone lomhlaba wonke."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "MySQL - Settings"
msgstr "I-MySQL - Izilungiselelo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These MySQL performance tuning settings will help your Cacti system perform better without issues for a longer time."
msgstr "Lezi zilungiselelo zokuthuthukisa ukusebenza kwe-MySQL zizosiza uhlelo lwakho lwe-Cacti ukuthi lusebenze kangcono ngaphandle kwezinkinga isikhathi eside."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Recommended MySQL System Variable Settings"
msgstr "Izilungiselelo Ezinconyiwe Zokuguquguqukayo Kwesistimu Ye-MySQL"

