msgstr "Inethiwekhi Yokuzishintshela Ezenzakalelayo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti can automatically scan the network once installation has completed. This will utilise the network range below to work out the range of IPs that can be scanned.  A predefined set of options are defined for scanning which include using both 'public' and 'private' communities."
msgstr "I-Cacti ingaskena inethiwekhi ngokuzenzakalela uma ukufaka sekuqediwe. Lokhu kuzosebenzisa ububanzi benethiwekhi obungezansi ukuthola ububanzi bama-IP angaskenwa. Isethi yezinketho echazwe ngaphambilini ichaziwe ukuze iskenwe okubandakanya ukusebenzisa imiphakathi ye-'public' kanye neye-'private'."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If your devices require a different set of options to be used first, you may define them below and they will be utilized before the defaults"
msgstr "Uma amadivayisi akho edinga isethi ehlukile yezinketho ezizosetshenziswa kuqala, ungazichaza ngezansi futhi zizosetshenziswa ngaphambi kokuzenzakalelayo"

