#: login_providers.php
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP addresses for valid LDAP servers.  Cacti will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user.<br><br>For One-Time Password (OTP/MFA) logins, do not use a space delimited multi-server list.  On a failed bind Cacti advances to the next server and re-binds with the same credentials, and the already-consumed one-time code will be rejected.  Instead enter a single, resilient DNS name fronted by a DNS load balancer (VIP) so that server failover is handled below Cacti and only one authentication bind is ever performed."
msgstr "Uhlu oluhlukaniswe ngesikhala lwamagama e-host e-DNS noma amakheli e-IP amaseva e-LDAP avumelekile. I-Cacti izozama ukusebenzisa amaseva e-LDAP ukusuka kwesobunxele kuya kwesokudla ukuze iqinisekise umsebenzisi.<br><br>Ekungeneni ngePhasiwedi Yesikhathi Esisodwa (OTP/MFA), ungasebenzisi uhlu lwamaseva amaningi oluhlukaniswe ngesikhala. Uma ukubopha (bind) kwehluleka, i-Cacti idlulela kuseva elandelayo futhi izame ukubopha futhi ngemininingwane efanayo, kanti ikhodi yesikhathi esisodwa esivele isetshenzisiwe izokwenqatshwa. Kunalokho, faka igama elilodwa le-DNS elizinzile eliholwa yi-DNS load balancer (VIP) ukuze ukushintshwa kweseva (failover) kusingathwe ngaphansi kwe-Cacti futhi kwenziwe ukubopha kokuqinisekisa okukodwa kuphela."

