msgstr "Indlela yefayela eya ohlwini lwemibhalo oluqukethe izitifiketi ezithenjwayo Zegunya Lesitifiketi Se-SSL. Lena ipharamitha yokuzikhethela engasetshenziswa esikhundleni sokunikeza indlela eya efayeleni elilodwa Legunya Lesitifiketi. Le pharamitha ingase idingwe ngumhlinzeki wedathabheyisi uma eqale i-SSL esebenzisa inketho ethi --ssl-mode=VERIFY_CA."

#: pollers.php
msgid "Provides a way to disable verification of the server's SSL certificate Common Name against the server's hostname when connecting. This verification is enabled by default."
msgstr "Inikeza indlela yokukhubaza ukuqinisekiswa kwe-Common Name yesitifiketi se-SSL seseva uma kuqhathaniswa negama le-host leseva lapho kuxhunywa. Lokhu kuqinisekiswa kunikwe amandla ngokuzenzakalelayo."

